# EAS Android production build (quota resume — 1 July 2026)

**Owner policy — treat like school gallery and deploy guardrails.** Expo free-tier Android builds were exhausted **June 2026**; quota resets **1 July 2026**. This automation must survive Cursor rule refreshes.

## After every Cursor update or rules reset

Confirm this file exists with **`alwaysApply: true`**. Re-register the Windows task if missing:

```powershell
powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File mobile/scripts/windows/Register-EasAndroidJulyBuildTask.ps1
Get-ScheduledTask -TaskName "Qwertymates-EAS-Android-July-Release"
```

