## Manual (from `mobile/`)

```bash
npm run verify:android-release-readiness
npm run release:android:play
```

If quota error persists after 1 July, retry daily — do **not** skip Play submit once build succeeds.

## Agent duty on/after 1 July 2026

When owner opens Cursor and EAS quota has reset:

1. Run `npm run verify:android-release-readiness` in `mobile/`.
2. Run `npm run release:android:play` (build + submit by build id).
3. Report `version`, `versionCode`, EAS build URL, Play submission URL.
4. Update `mobile/exports/eas-android-release-state.json` with `completedAt`.

Do not close a “resume Android release” task while quota is available but no production build was attempted.
